#: includes/class-admin-page.php:203
#, php-format
msgid "WhatsApp number (e.g. +6281234567890), email address (e.g. info@inpartnerglobal.com), or an absolute https:// URL on an approved domain: %s."
msgstr "WhatsApp番号（例：+6281234567890）、メールアドレス（例：info@inpartnerglobal.com）、または承認済みドメイン上の絶対 https:// URL：%s。"

